@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] authenticated-kexec-conversion
Conversion tests MUST boot the actual source OS, enter the pinned kexec image,
retain strict SSH authentication across that transition, then boot the installed
disks with a distinct authenticated identity. The production inventory guard,
formatter, storage receipt and KVM readiness check MUST execute on the actual
serial-numbered fixture hardware. Synthetic operator keys MUST remain
confined to the test composition. A fixture result MUST NOT imply provider acceptance.
